  "_comment": "One trash-clearing mode: Auto Play (pre-battle Options row, mask bit 3), hooked at the enemy-turn state entry 0xCE92E0 (unconditional, before the onEnemyTurn delegate). The sweep is shared: visible, alive, non-boss enemies; muteki -> SetHP(1); else CheckForDrops(e,false,expBonusCnt) + Die(). The old manual-defeat sweep (Entity.EndDrag 0x108DE34, armed by the 1-Hit byte) is gone: 1-Hit now only affects damage, so killing an enemy requires a pincer or any other damage. Bit 2 of the mask survives as the mirror of the one-hit byte so the state still persists. Auto keeps the one-hit byte set (cave 12) so bosses, which the sweep skips, still die in one hit.",
